WEBVTT

01:50.440 --> 01:51.440
I'm fine.

02:13.440 --> 02:15.800
He's already at the point
where he can't sleep without medicine.

02:22.560 --> 02:23.520
It's cold at night in the mountains.

02:23.600 --> 02:25.000
Take the bed.

02:38.200 --> 02:39.640
You want me to take the floor?

02:40.520 --> 02:42.720
You already gave the bed to me.

02:42.800 --> 02:44.040
You can't ask it back, can you?

03:07.000 --> 03:09.160
If you can't sleep, I can help.

03:11.240 --> 03:12.320
Don't knock me out.

03:13.040 --> 03:14.920
As soon as Qingyan
leaves the mines with the hostage,

03:15.000 --> 03:16.360
we can leave here.

03:17.200 --> 03:18.960
Qingyan will send a signal at any time.

03:19.040 --> 03:20.080
I must not fall asleep.

03:20.680 --> 03:23.440
Also, I may have night terrors.

03:23.520 --> 03:24.840
No need to be frightened.

03:24.920 --> 03:26.160
If that happens, just wake me up.

03:36.800 --> 03:37.840
I'll take the floor.

03:39.360 --> 03:40.200
Not necessary.

03:56.360 --> 03:58.120
- It is them.
- It is them.

03:58.200 --> 04:00.400
- I know it.
- I know it.

04:00.480 --> 04:02.680
It must be them.

04:02.760 --> 04:04.360
- I saw it myself.
- Kill them.

04:04.440 --> 04:05.400
The Weibei Army set the fire.

04:06.000 --> 04:07.880
It was their order to start the fire.

04:08.640 --> 04:09.600
Kill him!

04:09.680 --> 04:10.840
It's Big Brother's man…

04:18.040 --> 04:19.160
My Lord.

04:29.280 --> 04:30.280
My Lord.

04:33.160 --> 04:34.000
Did I scare you?

04:35.440 --> 04:36.800
I'm fine.

04:40.160 --> 04:43.360
It's my habit to sleep with a lamp on.

04:45.160 --> 04:46.720
Bring the oil lamp closer.

05:09.160 --> 05:10.320
Wait a moment.

05:30.120 --> 05:31.360
This is a nightshade.

05:31.440 --> 05:32.640
It can calm the nerves and help you sleep.

05:47.200 --> 05:48.040
Thank you.

05:54.680 --> 05:57.720
If you don't rest well,
it will affect our plans.

06:58.800 --> 06:59.720
Mei Lin.

07:01.760 --> 07:02.600
Mei Lin.

07:11.280 --> 07:13.520
- Where were you?
- I went to get some water.

07:16.960 --> 07:19.000
I'm heading up the mountain
to gather some wild fruit.

07:19.080 --> 07:20.040
I'll go with you.

07:20.120 --> 07:22.640
You'd better stay here
and wait for Qingyan's message.

07:26.520 --> 07:28.080
By now,

07:28.160 --> 07:29.800
Luomei should have reached
the West Mountain Mine.

07:30.320 --> 07:31.600
WEST MOUNTAIN MINE

07:34.520 --> 07:36.320
Hurry up. Move.

07:37.840 --> 07:38.680
Hurry!

07:40.120 --> 07:41.160
Don't dawdle.

07:42.720 --> 07:43.560
Move.

07:48.520 --> 07:50.040
YANG ZHEN, COMMANDER OF THE LULIN ARMY

07:50.720 --> 07:51.720
General Yin,

07:51.800 --> 07:53.920
the prisoners of war escaped
and disturbed the imperial inspection.

07:54.000 --> 07:54.920
It was my dereliction of duty.

07:55.000 --> 07:57.440
I will plead guilty with His Majesty.

07:57.520 --> 07:59.640
Now is not the time for blame.

07:59.720 --> 08:00.600
His Majesty has ordered

08:00.680 --> 08:02.960
three divisions of the Lulin Army
to besiege Lushan.

08:05.200 --> 08:06.760
General Yin, you know the rules.

08:06.840 --> 08:08.120
The Lulin Army won't leave
the West Mountain

08:08.200 --> 08:09.160
without a military tally.

08:34.600 --> 08:35.440
Commander Yang,

08:37.480 --> 08:39.120
is it verified?

08:41.520 --> 08:42.720
Verified.

08:44.240 --> 08:46.200
There's no time to lose. Take the troops
out of the mountain immediately.

08:47.920 --> 08:48.760
Yes, General.

08:49.320 --> 08:50.520
General Yin, after you.

08:53.680 --> 08:55.920
The prisoners are rioting.
Someone come quickly.

09:12.720 --> 09:14.120
General Yin,
the prisoners are out of control.

09:14.200 --> 09:15.120
I'll go handle it immediately.

09:15.200 --> 09:16.720
Protect General Yin.

09:16.800 --> 09:17.760
Yes.

09:26.920 --> 09:27.760
Run!

09:44.120 --> 09:45.640
They are killing people!
They are killing people!

09:46.520 --> 09:48.040
They are killing people!

09:48.920 --> 09:49.760
Take advantage of the chaos and go.

09:53.040 --> 09:54.040
Qingyan.

10:03.280 --> 10:04.880
Stop!

10:14.360 --> 10:16.080
- Take them away.
- Yes.

10:20.200 --> 10:21.280
Move.

10:23.200 --> 10:25.120
The Lulin Army released the prisoners
on purpose, didn't you?

10:25.200 --> 10:26.720
Commander Yang,

10:26.800 --> 10:30.120
did you orchestrate this riot
to obstruct the troop mobilization?

10:33.560 --> 10:34.680
Sun Tong.

10:36.880 --> 10:39.160
In the Lulin Army, only you and I

10:39.240 --> 10:40.880
have the authority
to manage the prisoners. Speak.

10:40.960 --> 10:41.800
Was this your doing?

10:44.440 --> 10:45.840
Yes. I released them.

10:49.080 --> 10:50.600
I was so stupid.

10:50.680 --> 10:51.680
I treated you well.

10:51.760 --> 10:53.760
Yet you've always coveted my position.

10:53.840 --> 10:54.960
If General Yin had been harmed today,

10:55.040 --> 10:55.920
you'd receive severe punishment.

10:56.520 --> 10:57.560
- Guards!
- Here!

10:57.640 --> 10:58.920
- Take Sun Tong away.
- Enough.

11:00.240 --> 11:02.120
I don't have time to watch you bicker.

11:02.200 --> 11:04.000
His Majesty will decide
what will happen to you.

11:04.720 --> 11:05.880
Gather the troops and set out immediately.

11:09.760 --> 11:10.960
Yes.

11:20.400 --> 11:22.960
Your Highness, I've done my best.

11:28.200 --> 11:30.360
Your Highness,
we searched the entire Lushan

11:30.440 --> 11:31.640
but found no trace of Prince Jing.

11:32.240 --> 11:33.400
However,

11:33.480 --> 11:36.080
the prisoners mentioned
seeing Prince Jing and a young woman.

11:36.800 --> 11:39.280
Based on the description,
that woman should be Mei Lin.

11:39.960 --> 11:41.680
It seems he disappeared on purpose.

11:42.960 --> 11:43.920
Release the falcons.

11:44.800 --> 11:46.920
Not a single mountain nearby
can be overlooked.

11:47.720 --> 11:48.560
Yes, Your Highness.

12:02.920 --> 12:03.960
Any news yet?

12:07.040 --> 12:09.640
To avoid exposure, Qingyan and I agreed

12:09.720 --> 12:11.680
to cease contact if there was no news.

12:12.280 --> 12:14.680
So, no news is the best news.

12:17.160 --> 12:18.360
By now,

12:18.440 --> 12:20.800
they should have already
rescued the witness

12:20.880 --> 12:21.960
from the West Mountain Mine.

12:30.960 --> 12:31.880
She is one of us.

12:34.280 --> 12:35.520
He's Pang Qi,
Commander of the Weibei Army.

12:36.480 --> 12:37.680
This is Mei Lin.

12:39.080 --> 12:40.720
Is she your new guard?

12:40.800 --> 12:41.960
- No.
- No.

12:47.520 --> 12:49.800
My Lord, we've finally found you.

12:49.880 --> 12:51.840
We intended
to jump off the cliff with you,

12:51.920 --> 12:53.120
but the Imperial Guards arrived.

12:53.200 --> 12:54.360
We were afraid
they'd discover your tracks,

12:54.440 --> 12:55.400
so we took a different route.

12:55.480 --> 12:57.520
Next, we'll head to Xiaoyun Peak,

12:57.600 --> 12:58.760
the highest point in Zhongshan.

12:58.840 --> 13:00.760
Only there can we light the signal fire

13:00.840 --> 13:02.200
so the Imperial Guards can see it.

13:12.720 --> 13:14.360
The falcon! Hide quickly!

13:20.720 --> 13:21.560
Your Excellency.

13:22.320 --> 13:23.200
Please rise.

13:24.280 --> 13:25.680
Did I injure you with the kick?

13:26.360 --> 13:27.880
I'm fine. The kick was light,
Your Excellency.

13:29.520 --> 13:32.000
As you expected, a prisoner is missing.

13:32.080 --> 13:33.160
What?

13:35.680 --> 13:37.720
Your Excellency,
could you have made a mistake?

13:38.320 --> 13:41.920
No way. Qingyan has been serving
Prince Jing since childhood.

13:43.120 --> 13:44.200
Ten years ago,

13:44.760 --> 13:46.760
we fought once
on the military training ground.

13:46.840 --> 13:48.760
Won't it be impossible

13:48.840 --> 13:50.000
to cover up the fact

13:50.080 --> 13:51.040
that His Highness and Your Excellency
have released the prisoners

13:51.640 --> 13:52.640
and attempted to assassinate Prince Jing?

14:10.160 --> 14:11.000
Sun Tong,

14:12.080 --> 14:13.080
listen carefully.

14:13.160 --> 14:16.280
Take the fake account book
and report to the court.

14:17.080 --> 14:18.080
You'll claim that Yang Zhen

14:18.160 --> 14:20.480
was amassing wealth
by secretly trading prisoners.

14:21.520 --> 14:23.200
Unexpectedly, an accident occurred,

14:23.280 --> 14:24.840
allowing the prisoners of war to escape
to the hunting ground

14:24.920 --> 14:25.920
and disturb His Majesty.

14:26.480 --> 14:27.320
Feeling ashamed,

14:28.360 --> 14:30.120
Yang Zhen committed suicide

14:32.720 --> 14:33.720
and is already dead.

14:33.800 --> 14:35.120
Your Excellency, why do you…

14:35.200 --> 14:37.920
I have to take the blame.

14:38.000 --> 14:39.920
Only then
can His Majesty escape unscathed.

14:40.000 --> 14:41.160
And you can escape too.

14:41.240 --> 14:43.240
- We can defect to Prince Jing!
- No.

14:45.760 --> 14:47.720
Prince Jing, favored by His Majesty,

14:48.320 --> 14:49.800
opposes His Highness whenever he can.

14:50.680 --> 14:52.120
If the throne

14:52.200 --> 14:55.120
is seized by someone so ridiculous,
who kills so casually,

14:55.200 --> 14:57.120
Great Yan will be in grave danger.
The people will suffer.

14:57.200 --> 14:58.400
But, Your Excellency,

14:58.480 --> 15:00.160
though for His Highness' kindness,

15:00.240 --> 15:02.640
you don't have to sacrifice
your life for him.

15:11.520 --> 15:14.200
I was merely the son of a stableman.

15:14.280 --> 15:17.200
If not for His Highness
opening the academies,

15:17.280 --> 15:18.600
I would never have received education
and become an official.

15:19.600 --> 15:21.560
After I joined the court,
it was His Highness

15:21.640 --> 15:23.080
who disregarded my background

15:23.160 --> 15:25.080
and promoted me.

15:28.600 --> 15:30.520
I believe that His Highness

15:32.400 --> 15:34.880
will be the final victor.

15:48.280 --> 15:49.120
Sun Tong,

15:49.920 --> 15:51.360
I need you to do one more thing.

15:51.960 --> 15:54.560
After I'm gone, immediately send
a letter to the Eastern Palace.

15:55.120 --> 15:56.240
Your Highness,

15:57.560 --> 15:58.400
farewell.

16:00.200 --> 16:01.440
Master!

16:06.040 --> 16:07.720
Commander Yang often spoke
of the jujube tree in his hometown,

16:07.800 --> 16:09.560
wishing to return someday.

16:09.640 --> 16:12.080
Now he has died far from home,
bearing a tarnished reputation.

16:13.360 --> 16:14.480
Commander Yang

16:15.480 --> 16:16.640
is gone.

16:18.960 --> 16:20.240
Your Highness,
please accept my condolences.

16:20.880 --> 16:22.880
Send someone
to take Yang Zhen back to his hometown

16:22.960 --> 16:24.680
and bury him beneath the jujube tree
in his courtyard.

16:25.360 --> 16:26.920
Provide for his family
for three generations.

16:28.680 --> 16:29.760
Yes, Your Highness.

16:30.480 --> 16:33.520
Your Highness, now that Commander Yang
has taken the blame,

16:33.600 --> 16:36.920
the prisoner Qingyan rescued
poses no threat,

16:37.000 --> 16:38.160
no matter what he knows.

16:40.120 --> 16:41.600
Jinghe took such a risk.

16:41.680 --> 16:43.240
It must be related
to the old case in Qingzhou.

16:45.440 --> 16:46.600
Set up checkpoints along the route

16:46.680 --> 16:47.760
to intercept Qingyan and his companions.

16:47.840 --> 16:49.120
Don't arouse Luomei's suspicion.

16:49.960 --> 16:51.000
Yes, Your Highness.

16:52.000 --> 16:54.400
Yang Zhen, thank you.

17:06.119 --> 17:07.440
I want to go home.

17:07.520 --> 17:09.880
I want to go home.

17:10.440 --> 17:11.760
He's feigning madness.

17:12.640 --> 17:14.400
No. He seems genuinely mad.

17:15.000 --> 17:16.160
Take him back to Zhaojing.

17:16.240 --> 17:18.640
If he's truly ill,
let the physicians treat him.

17:18.720 --> 17:20.880
If he's faking it,
His Lordship will know what to do.

17:20.960 --> 17:22.240
- I want to go home.
- Let's go.

17:22.319 --> 17:24.160
- I want to go home.
- Move.

17:24.240 --> 17:26.000
I want to go home
and eat white steamed buns.

17:27.400 --> 17:28.880
I want to eat steamed buns.

17:30.480 --> 17:32.640
I want steamed buns.

17:33.880 --> 17:35.720
- Hurry up.
- Halt.

17:36.800 --> 17:39.160
After I finish eating, I'll go home.

17:39.680 --> 17:40.520
Let's go.

17:42.680 --> 17:45.520
Don't kill me.

17:45.600 --> 17:46.520
Don't kill me.

17:58.800 --> 18:01.120
Set up a checkpoint here.
No one shall pass.

18:01.200 --> 18:02.080
Yes.

18:16.640 --> 18:17.520
My Lord,

18:18.120 --> 18:20.080
should I shoot down
the Crown Prince's bird?

18:20.680 --> 18:21.720
No.

18:22.400 --> 18:23.600
If you shoot the falcon,

18:23.680 --> 18:25.840
the Crown Prince will know
we're in Zhongshan.

18:26.920 --> 18:28.160
Then, what's your plan, my Lord?

18:28.760 --> 18:30.240
There's no need to ask his Lordship.

18:31.160 --> 18:32.880
He will issue the orders when he's ready.

18:34.040 --> 18:35.280
I'm worried about Qingyan.

18:41.640 --> 18:44.000
My Lord, Li Qing is rescued.
I'm surrounded by Imperial Guards.

18:47.920 --> 18:49.040
Shoot the falcon.

18:49.560 --> 18:50.600
My Lord, aren't you worried
the Crown Prince will discover us?

18:51.280 --> 18:53.240
There's been a change of plan.
Qingyan is in danger.

18:53.320 --> 18:54.160
Yes, my Lord.

19:01.520 --> 19:02.760
Zhongshan.

19:02.840 --> 19:04.120
Prince Jing is hiding in Zhongshan.

19:04.200 --> 19:05.840
But Zhongshan is too vast.

19:06.480 --> 19:07.600
Searching it will require manpower.

19:07.680 --> 19:10.000
Intercepting Qingyan
will require manpower too. Well…

19:10.080 --> 19:12.800
Gather all our forces.
Send everyone to Zhongshan.

19:13.640 --> 19:14.960
Block every exit.

19:16.320 --> 19:17.560
You must find Prince Jing.

19:18.720 --> 19:19.560
Yes, Your Highness.

19:19.640 --> 19:21.000
Everyone, listen up!

19:21.960 --> 19:23.840
You two, guard this spot.
The rest of you, follow me.

19:23.920 --> 19:24.720
- Yes.
- Yes.

19:27.360 --> 19:28.600
If the Crown Prince
discovers anything amiss,

19:28.680 --> 19:31.320
I will reveal my location to buy you time.

19:31.400 --> 19:32.960
No. You are putting yourself in danger…

19:33.040 --> 19:34.360
Follow my command.

19:36.600 --> 19:37.480
Yes, my Lord.

19:38.600 --> 19:39.760
Charge over with me.

19:46.600 --> 19:47.440
Let's go.

19:47.520 --> 19:49.040
Don't kill me.

19:56.800 --> 19:59.760
It takes only a day
to travel from Lushan to Zhongshan.

20:00.680 --> 20:03.000
Let's take the opportunity to get ready.

20:27.440 --> 20:29.720
The earth stirs,
but the sky does not respond.

20:30.320 --> 20:32.920
Tomorrow morning,
there will be only light fog.

20:39.120 --> 20:40.520
Don't kill me.

20:41.240 --> 20:42.080
Don't kill me.

20:43.640 --> 20:45.040
I want steamed buns.

20:45.120 --> 20:46.320
Don't kill me.

20:46.400 --> 20:47.640
We're safe now.

20:47.720 --> 20:49.640
- You must take him back to Zhaojing.
- Yes.

20:49.720 --> 20:51.320
- Let's go.
- I want steamed buns. White steamed buns.

20:52.160 --> 20:53.400
I want steamed buns.

21:07.080 --> 21:07.920
You fear ravens?

21:11.080 --> 21:12.200
I don't fear them.

21:13.120 --> 21:14.120
I just despise them.

21:24.840 --> 21:27.440
Search thoroughly. If you encounter
Prince Jing, release the signal.

21:27.520 --> 21:28.800
- Yes, sir.
- Yes, sir.

21:28.880 --> 21:30.160
Go.

22:17.880 --> 22:19.320
Extinguish the fire!

22:25.520 --> 22:26.760
Release the signal!

22:36.640 --> 22:37.680
They're just ahead.

22:38.440 --> 22:39.320
Chase after them.

22:39.400 --> 22:40.480
Chase after them!

22:53.120 --> 22:53.960
Kill Prince Jing!

25:11.640 --> 25:13.120
Pang!

25:23.000 --> 25:25.040
Pang. Pang!

25:43.080 --> 25:44.000
General,

25:46.080 --> 25:48.920
I, Pang Qi, of the Weibei Army,

25:49.680 --> 25:52.120
have finished my mission.

25:56.160 --> 25:57.200
Pang.

25:58.080 --> 25:59.320
Pang!

26:09.720 --> 26:11.280
Mei Lin, take his Lordship
and leave quickly.

26:14.520 --> 26:15.760
My Lord.

26:16.360 --> 26:18.920
- My Lord, leave now!
- Let's go. Let's go!

26:24.520 --> 26:25.960
- Chase after them.
- Yes, sir.

26:26.520 --> 26:27.360
Let's go.

26:36.800 --> 26:38.360
Let's split up and head for Xiaoyun Peak.

26:47.240 --> 26:48.520
A former soldier of the Weibei Army.

26:49.320 --> 26:50.200
Yes.

27:00.560 --> 27:01.920
They can't run far.

27:24.760 --> 27:26.600
Your Highness, there are traces
of Prince Jing inside the cabin,

27:26.680 --> 27:27.640
but no one is in there.

27:28.720 --> 27:31.160
With Jinghe's personality,
even if he's cornered,

27:31.240 --> 27:32.600
he won't give up without a fight.

27:41.280 --> 27:42.320
Your Highness,

27:43.000 --> 27:44.240
that's Prince Jing's signal fire.

27:44.320 --> 27:46.600
Xiaoyun Peak. They're at Xiaoyun Peak.

27:46.680 --> 27:48.000
Your Highness, should we go after them?

27:48.680 --> 27:50.840
If the Imperial Guards see the signal,
they'll rush there too.

28:00.200 --> 28:02.600
How did you know the Crown Prince
would definitely head to Xiaoyun Peak?

28:03.600 --> 28:04.440
Because he can't afford to take a risk.

28:05.240 --> 28:07.840
Searching the mountain again
will take a day.

28:07.920 --> 28:10.400
But checking Xiaoyun Peak
takes only half a day.

28:11.240 --> 28:13.520
If the Crown Prince wants to kill me,

28:14.120 --> 28:15.120
he'll have to take the risk.

28:16.000 --> 28:17.080
Let's go.

28:17.160 --> 28:19.520
Only when we reach Lushan will we win.

28:34.200 --> 28:35.440
We'll go back to Lushan from here?

28:36.480 --> 28:39.080
The path is rugged, but it's safe.

28:40.280 --> 28:41.760
There are no climbing holds on this cliff.

28:47.920 --> 28:49.480
You have considered even this.

28:50.960 --> 28:53.160
When I was a child, I took this route.

28:53.240 --> 28:54.400
I was at Sunset Cliff.

28:54.480 --> 28:55.360
if not for the accident,

28:55.440 --> 28:57.480
I could have slowly climbed down here.

29:02.120 --> 29:03.320
I'll go first.

29:45.000 --> 29:47.080
There's water and food along this path.

29:47.760 --> 29:49.560
The pursuing soldiers
have been diverted by Qingyan.

29:49.640 --> 29:51.160
For now, we're indeed safe.

29:53.000 --> 29:54.600
But if the Crown Prince

29:54.680 --> 29:56.360
sends people to encircle us
from Sunset Cliff,

29:57.040 --> 29:58.520
we'll be walking into his trap.

29:59.280 --> 30:02.400
He won't dare.
I disappeared at Sunset Cliff.

30:02.480 --> 30:05.400
Father will certainly have his trusted
Imperial Guards stationed at Sunset Cliff.

30:06.560 --> 30:08.440
Unless the Crown Prince
wishes to die with me,

30:08.520 --> 30:11.600
he won't try to kill me
right under Father's nose.

30:22.440 --> 30:23.520
It's just larks.

30:27.120 --> 30:28.480
I despise ravens

30:30.280 --> 30:32.440
because they always wait for death.

30:48.520 --> 30:50.160
Ravens only eat the dead.

30:50.880 --> 30:53.280
As long as you're breathing,
they'll fear you.

31:02.920 --> 31:04.440
The truth is, I'm afraid of dying.

31:05.640 --> 31:06.880
But I can't die,

31:08.360 --> 31:10.280
not on the way to revenge.

31:12.200 --> 31:13.280
What about you, my Lord?

31:14.400 --> 31:15.680
What do you fear?

31:21.840 --> 31:23.120
I fear losing.

31:25.240 --> 31:28.160
Anyone who's been on a battlefield
fears losing.

31:30.240 --> 31:33.120
The battlefield is a slaughterhouse.

31:33.720 --> 31:34.840
Except killing,

31:35.520 --> 31:37.320
there's no time to think of anything else.

31:38.560 --> 31:42.240
When your comrades die,
you have only three seconds to grieve.

31:44.520 --> 31:45.640
The Weibei Army had an order.

31:45.720 --> 31:48.800
During the battle, if a comrade fell,

31:49.600 --> 31:51.040
we would tap our chests three times.

31:51.960 --> 31:53.160
That was our way of mourning.

31:54.920 --> 31:56.080
On the battlefield,

31:56.920 --> 31:59.760
only victory ends the killing.

32:00.640 --> 32:01.640
For generals,

32:02.520 --> 32:04.760
winning as fast as they can

32:05.560 --> 32:07.040
is the greatest mercy.

32:09.840 --> 32:12.320
It seems I want to win so badly

32:13.760 --> 32:15.200
that I've forgotten

32:16.080 --> 32:17.960
I'm no longer General Weibei.

32:20.480 --> 32:21.880
Taking revenge

32:22.760 --> 32:24.680
isn't the same as going to war.

32:57.240 --> 32:58.840
Your Highness, we've been tricked.

32:58.920 --> 33:00.920
They indeed returned to Lushan
by this path.

33:03.000 --> 33:04.320
- Take the trail to pursue them.
- Yes.

33:04.400 --> 33:05.280
Stop the pursuit.

33:06.480 --> 33:08.840
We're a day behind.
There's no way to catch up.

33:10.280 --> 33:11.160
Your Highness,

33:11.240 --> 33:13.400
this path leads only to Sunset Cliff.

33:13.480 --> 33:14.800
We can send a message to our men

33:14.880 --> 33:16.640
to have them encircle the cliff
from below.

33:17.520 --> 33:19.440
But the top of Sunset Cliff
is guarded by Father's men.

33:19.520 --> 33:21.000
Our forces can't get down.

33:24.560 --> 33:26.120
How many days will it take
to return from here to Sunset Cliff?

33:26.880 --> 33:27.840
At least five days.

33:28.960 --> 33:31.680
If a man doesn't eat or drink
for five days,

33:31.760 --> 33:32.720
what will happen?

33:41.160 --> 33:42.720
What are you carrying that smells so foul?

33:42.800 --> 33:45.280
General, it's the remains of a hunt.

33:45.360 --> 33:47.720
The stench from the corpse
must be overwhelming.

33:47.800 --> 33:51.360
I was ordered to bury it
far from the hunting palace.

33:51.440 --> 33:53.880
There's a ban at Sunset Cliff.
Bury it elsewhere.

33:54.520 --> 33:56.280
Yes.

34:47.880 --> 34:48.880
The water is poisoned.

34:51.239 --> 34:54.400
The Crown Prince did this.
He poisoned the upstream to trap us.

34:54.480 --> 34:56.719
Now, he must have sent his men

34:56.800 --> 34:57.800
to guard at the bottom.

34:57.880 --> 35:00.560
There's no way back.
We can only move forward.

35:01.800 --> 35:03.880
But what if we do not eat or drink?

35:06.360 --> 35:07.560
The Crown Prince

35:07.640 --> 35:09.200
will keep poisoning the water to trap us.

35:10.240 --> 35:12.360
Qingyan will surely notice this

35:12.440 --> 35:13.600
and come to our aid.

35:16.000 --> 35:17.640
But if he can't arrive in time…

35:24.440 --> 35:27.320
I once led an attack
on the Xiyan royal camp.

35:27.400 --> 35:29.880
The vanguard could last four days
at most without food or water.

35:29.960 --> 35:32.720
I managed to crawl out
of a pile of corpses back then.

35:32.800 --> 35:35.200
Now, I can do it again.

35:36.160 --> 35:37.240
We'll survive together.

35:49.600 --> 35:50.960
Cheers.

35:54.560 --> 35:56.200
His Majesty is worried
about Prince Jing now.

35:56.280 --> 35:57.120
Who has the mood to hunt?

35:57.720 --> 35:59.800
Now, we're down to roasting
a few wild hares.

36:00.560 --> 36:01.760
After all these days,

36:02.320 --> 36:03.560
we haven't seen a single living prisoner.

36:04.680 --> 36:06.120
Is this an act?

36:08.200 --> 36:11.240
Are you saying Prince Jing
disappeared on purpose?

36:13.360 --> 36:14.960
Why would he do that?

36:16.240 --> 36:17.480
It's a test.

36:17.560 --> 36:19.520
Prince Jing is testing
His Majesty's favor toward him.

36:20.160 --> 36:21.000
Look.

36:21.520 --> 36:23.360
Now the whole court knows

36:23.440 --> 36:25.920
the Third Prince
is His Majesty's favorite.

36:27.320 --> 36:28.520
In terms of talent and influence,

36:29.160 --> 36:30.640
the Crown Prince far surpasses
Prince Jing.

36:31.320 --> 36:33.720
But nothing matters more
than His Majesty's favor.

36:35.520 --> 36:37.120
There's no point speculating now.

36:37.200 --> 36:39.840
Let's just find Prince Jing first.

36:40.640 --> 36:41.640
Cut that out.

36:41.720 --> 36:42.920
Come on. Cheers.

36:50.240 --> 36:52.800
Everyone says
Prince Jing disappeared on purpose.

36:52.880 --> 36:53.840
Your Highness, don't worry.

36:55.680 --> 36:56.760
Who's worried about him?

36:57.480 --> 36:58.960
That man is full of schemes.

37:06.040 --> 37:07.680
Your Highness, His Majesty isn't here.

37:11.360 --> 37:13.600
Why do you care about
Prince Jing's whereabouts?

37:15.440 --> 37:17.920
His Majesty hasn't eaten properly
for days.

37:18.000 --> 37:19.520
I'm worried about His Majesty.

37:21.840 --> 37:23.560
His Majesty's been nice to me.

37:23.640 --> 37:25.280
But there's nothing I can do.

37:27.320 --> 37:28.560
Tell me.

37:29.280 --> 37:32.080
Will the gods
protect the Emperor of Great Yan?

37:33.040 --> 37:34.320
I'm not sure.

37:35.040 --> 37:37.720
But they'll surely protect Your Highness.

37:37.800 --> 37:39.960
Didn't you pray to the gods

37:40.040 --> 37:42.840
for Mei Lin to be with Mr. Yue Qin?

37:42.920 --> 37:44.880
Maybe it's a sign from the gods.

37:44.960 --> 37:46.320
That's why Prince Jing hasn't returned.

37:48.600 --> 37:50.240
I didn't mean it like that.

37:50.960 --> 37:53.440
Even if Prince Jing isn't a good person,

37:53.520 --> 37:55.440
he's still a human life.

37:55.520 --> 37:58.480
Then you should quickly ask the gods
to take back your wish.

38:05.760 --> 38:06.600
Gods,

38:07.440 --> 38:09.080
all my wishes were sincere.

38:09.160 --> 38:10.840
Please grant them.

38:15.200 --> 38:17.360
But I also don't want anything wrong
to happen to Prince Jing.

38:17.880 --> 38:20.280
Please guide Prince Jing back safely.

38:21.160 --> 38:24.280
If Prince Jing returns,
His Majesty will regain his appetite.

38:25.240 --> 38:27.720
His Majesty hasn't eaten properly
for days.

38:32.920 --> 38:35.600
Your Highness, it's getting late.

38:35.680 --> 38:37.000
Let's head back.

39:01.520 --> 39:03.680
Your Highness, General Yin has returned
with reinforcements.

39:03.760 --> 39:06.120
It seems she was injured by a prisoner.

39:18.400 --> 39:20.960
Forgive my rudeness.
I heard you were wounded.

39:21.760 --> 39:23.480
Where's your injury? Who hurt you?

39:24.080 --> 39:26.000
I had a minor injury during
the suppression. It doesn't matter.

39:26.600 --> 39:27.680
The court physician is outside the tent.

39:27.760 --> 39:29.200
Let him treat you.

39:35.800 --> 39:37.080
I was delayed half a day
for getting the reinforcements.

39:37.160 --> 39:39.640
For Prince Jing,
that's half a day of more danger.

39:39.720 --> 39:42.080
The most important thing now
is to find Prince Jing.

39:45.880 --> 39:47.840
Luomei, there's news of Jinghe.

39:49.960 --> 39:52.520
Why don't you
join me in reporting to Father?

39:56.960 --> 39:58.600
You said Jinghe was in Zhongshan

39:58.680 --> 40:00.000
and lit a signal fire.

40:00.920 --> 40:02.120
The patrolling Imperial Guards saw it.

40:02.200 --> 40:05.040
I reached Zhongshan
but found no trace of Jinghe.

40:05.120 --> 40:07.040
I only found a hunter's cabin

40:07.120 --> 40:09.880
stocked with supplies
of food and medicine.

40:09.960 --> 40:11.120
It didn't look like
it belonged to a hunter.

40:12.280 --> 40:13.360
Could Prince Jing
have disappeared on purpose?

40:18.640 --> 40:19.480
Forgive my presumption.

40:21.640 --> 40:23.040
Do you think so too?

40:25.000 --> 40:26.960
Jinghe and I have raised falcons together.

40:27.040 --> 40:29.200
I found a dead falcon in Zhongshan.

40:30.600 --> 40:31.600
The arrow in it

40:31.680 --> 40:33.240
has the insignia of Prince Jing's Mansion.

40:39.120 --> 40:41.120
What is Jinghe up to now?

40:42.000 --> 40:43.120
Father, rest assured.

40:43.200 --> 40:45.680
At least it indicates
Third Brother is currently safe.

40:48.160 --> 40:49.000
Fine.

40:50.080 --> 40:51.240
It's good to have some news.

40:51.320 --> 40:53.960
Division One of the Lulin Army
will stay at the hunting palace.

40:55.000 --> 40:57.520
You will personally lead Division Two
and bring Jinghe back.

40:58.120 --> 41:00.160
No matter what he is up to,
bring him back first.

41:00.240 --> 41:02.120
Tell him it's my decree.

41:02.200 --> 41:03.480
But you must ensure his safety.

41:05.040 --> 41:06.120
Yes, Father.

41:06.200 --> 41:07.400
Your Majesty,

41:07.480 --> 41:10.160
I can assist His Highness
in the search for Prince Jing.

41:10.880 --> 41:13.200
I was delayed in deploying the troops.
If Prince Jing suffers any harm,

41:13.960 --> 41:15.040
I will not be able to escape the blame.

41:16.640 --> 41:17.680
This isn't your fault, General Yin.

41:18.560 --> 41:20.480
Yang Zhen of the Lulin Army
released the prisoners of war.

41:20.560 --> 41:21.480
He's already killed himself
to escape punishment.

41:22.360 --> 41:25.160
His deputy, Sun Tong,
even dared to harm you, General Yin.

41:25.240 --> 41:26.200
He should be severely punished.

41:29.320 --> 41:30.200
Deal with the Lulin Army's affairs

41:30.280 --> 41:31.960
as you see fit.

41:33.240 --> 41:35.400
General Yin, assist the Crown Prince

41:35.480 --> 41:36.560
in finding Jinghe.

41:37.440 --> 41:39.000
- Yes, Your Majesty.
- Yes, Father.
